## 작업 사항\r\n- 기존에 사용하던 Lottie 파일에 대해 마지막 프레임까지 채워진 하트가 유지되는 정상적인 Lottie 파일로 변경\r\n\r\n## 참고\r\n- resolved: #493 \r\n- Set progress to 1.0f do not set last frame of the animation into the LottieAnimationView","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daily-DAYO/DAYO_Android/issues/494/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Daily-DAYO/DAYO_Android/issues/494/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"}]